<title>USA: Biomet declares $0.11/shr payout.</title>
<headline>Biomet declares $0.11/shr payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW, Ind. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomet Inc, which makes products used by orthopedic medical specialists, said Wednesday it declared a cash dividend of $0.11 a share.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the dividend is an annual payout, which compares with $0.10 a share paid a year ago.</p>
<p>Biomet said the dividend will be payable August 8 to shareholders of record at the close of business July 11.</p>
<p>&quot;The declaration of this dividend is an expression of appreciation for the continued support of our shareholders and reflects the board's confidence and optimism in Biomet's operational direction,&quot; Dane Miller, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
